* 1 Nov 26 dm  New.  S.95 stage 1b: the administrator's way, at a plain terminal, to set up the authenticator code the sdsys login over ssh asks for,
*              to get new recovery codes and to switch the code off.  TOOL.REMOTE's sixth view hands the terminal to this verb, so the secret is handled here only.
* 2 Nov 26 dm  S.101 stage D: LOCAL ON | OFF.
